@startuml architecture_view
title Municipal Report Management System — Use Case View (GR10-Q4)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "User" as User
actor "Authenticated User" as AuthUser
actor "Citizen" as Citizen
actor "Municipal Operator" as Operator

AuthUser <|-- Citizen
AuthUser <|-- Operator

rectangle "Municipal reporting system" {
  usecase "User Registration" as UC_Reg
  usecase "Create New Report" as UC_Create
  usecase "Add Additional Information" as UC_AddInfo
  usecase "View Submitted Reports" as UC_ViewSub
  usecase "View Received Reports" as UC_ViewRec
  usecase "View Report Details" as UC_Details
  usecase "Update Report Status" as UC_Status
  usecase "Send Notification to Citizen" as UC_Notify
  usecase "Monitor Activity Progress" as UC_Monitor
  usecase "Add Internal Note" as UC_Note
}

User --> UC_Reg

Citizen --> UC_Create
Citizen --> UC_ViewSub

Operator --> UC_ViewRec
Operator --> UC_Status
Operator --> UC_Monitor
Operator --> UC_Note

UC_AddInfo .up.> UC_Create : <<extend>>
UC_Details .up.> UC_ViewSub : <<extend>>
UC_Details .up.> UC_ViewRec : <<extend>>
UC_Notify .up.> UC_Status : <<extend>>

note right of UC_Status
  Report lifecycle:
  Submitted → Assigned →
  In Progress → Resolved
end note

@enduml
